<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2023-agential-01--grok--operationalizability> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Operationalizability of levin-2023-agential-01 by Grok 4.7: 0.45";
